    <label>Baby's breath</label>
    <description>To pay off her debts, Baby's breath became a Fixer of the Northern Девять Association and works as a courier, relying on her Delivery Box and the Porudnitsa within to handle threats along the way.</description>
    <detailedReport>25 years old, female, Baby's breath. Once a minor celebrity, she lost her memory in a car accident and was released by her agency.\n\nA tiny dot rushing across this planet delivering goods, time has become her greatest threat.\n\nOccasionally, when she has spare time, she runs into former fans on the road, and can only learn from other people's mouths what she used to be like.\n\nThe 하나 Association has verified her dispatch records. Baby's breath is willing to take on the colony's cargo transport and external social work. Please provide ample supplies and time.</detailedReport>
    <arrivalGreeting>Thank you for supporting the Девять Association's long-term personnel dispatch service. But... I'm not late, am I?</arrivalGreeting>
